  "name": "remove-swc-with-dependents",
  "description": "A `remove` of a whole component with `with_dependents: true`: the server states the unlinking itself, as ordinary removals run after the client's, and the delta marks each of its rows `origin: \"server\"` — the connector with an end on the component, its member of the root composition, its task runnable entry and the sequence whose last step it was, removed whole. The approved scope covers the server's rows like the client's: a scope that did not would refuse the set `unauthorized-delta`.",
